graph TD
    Start([Mulai: Beli Akses Pro / Plus]) --> SelectTier[Pilih Paket Langganan di PricingModal]
    SelectTier --> SelectMode{Pilih Jalur Pembayaran}
    
    SelectMode -- Opsi B: Headless Pop-up --> ReqOrderB[POST /api/orders: checkoutMode=headless]
    ReqOrderB --> CallMPG_B[API Gateway MPG: Generate QRIS Dinamis ASPI]
    CallMPG_B --> ShowQR[Tampilkan Modal QRIS Dinamis + Kode Unik + Timer 15 Menit]
    ShowQR --> UserScans[Pengguna Scan QRIS via BCA / Mandiri / GoPay / ShopeePay]
    
    SelectMode -- Opsi A: Hosted Checkout --> ReqOrderA[POST /api/orders: checkoutMode=hosted]
    ReqOrderA --> CallMPG_A[API Gateway MPG: Buat URL Tagihan]
    CallMPG_A --> Redirect[Redirect ke URL Hosted Checkout MPG]
    Redirect --> UserScans

    SelectMode -- Opsi C: Manual GoBiz --> ShowManual[Tampilkan QRIS Statis GoBiz]
    ShowManual --> UserTransferManual[Transfer Manual & Konfirmasi via WhatsApp] --> AdminReview[Admin Verifikasi Manual di Tab 4] --> AdminApprove[Admin Klik Approve] --> ActiveAccount[Akun Menjadi Pro 30 Hari] --> End([Selesai])

    UserScans --> BankNotif[Sistem Bank Kirim Notifikasi Transaksi ke MPG]
    BankNotif --> MPGWebhook[MPG Kirim Webhook POST /api/webhook/payment-success]
    MPGWebhook --> VerifySig{Verifikasi Signature HMAC?}
    VerifySig -- Salah --> Reject401[Tolak Request HTTP 401] --> End
    VerifySig -- Benar --> CheckIdemp{Sudah Terbayar Sebelumnya?}
    CheckIdemp -- Ya --> Return200[Kembalikan HTTP 200: Idempotent Skip] --> End
    CheckIdemp -- Belum --> UpdateOrder[Update payment_orders: status=approved]
    UpdateOrder --> UpgradeTier[Update profiles: subscription_tier=pro / plus + 30 Hari]
    UpgradeTier --> PollingDetect[Polling Client Deteksi Status Lunas]
    PollingDetect --> Confetti[Pemicu Selebrasi Confetti & Refresh Halaman] --> End
